<title>USA: Reuters nineth ex-Miami air cargo market report.</title>
<headline>Reuters nineth ex-Miami air cargo market report.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Below are the current air freight rates from Miami International airport to key destinations in Latin America and Europe. These rates are exclusive of cargo fuel surcharges being applied by airlines.</p>
<p>		    Jan 24		    Nov 21</p>
<p>			    BRAZIL</p>
<p> MIA-SAO	  2.01			 2.05</p>
<p>			    COLOMBIA</p>
<p> MIA-BOG	  0.61			 0.63</p>
<p>			    ARGENTINE</p>
<p> MIA-BUE	  1.90			 1.98</p>
<p>			    CHILE</p>
<p> MIA-SCL	  1.72		    unquoted</p>
<p>			    EUROPE</p>
<p> MIA-LHR	  1.20			 1.20</p>
<p>*The rates quoted in this report were obtained by Reuters journalists on a confidential basis from a range of airlines, large forwarders and smaller air cargo agents.</p>
<p>*All prices quoted in U.S. dollars.</p>
<p>*The tariffs represent average rates calculated from a range of prices and are indicative or current market activity. -- Miami News Bureau, 305-374-5013</p>
